          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: CHARCHIGNE (53) 19.08.1990 Ti1 LASSAY-LES-CHATEAUX (53) 19.08.1990 T1 LASSAY-LES-CHATEAUX (53) 19.08.1990 T2",
          "text_sha256": "13200d462ff44f6dc029822dbc5ecd887418dccd4dd8767f50468371d8fceb5e"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
